<p>Hi <%= @client.displayed_name %>,</p>

<p>Your session with <strong><%= @expert.displayed_name %></strong> has ended. We hope it was valuable!</p>

<div class="detail-box">
  <table>
    <tr><td>Service</td><td><%= @service.title %></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Date</td><td><%= @booking.start_time.strftime("%A, %b %-d %Y") %></td></tr>
  </table>
</div>

<p>Please take a moment to leave a review for <%= @expert.displayed_name %>. Reviews help other clients choose the right experts.</p>

<p><a class="btn" style="color: #ffffff;" href="http://<%= @tenant.domain.presence || "#{@tenant.ident}.experthub.localhost" %>/dashboard">Leave a Review</a></p>

<p>Thanks for booking with us!</p>
